<title>SINGAPORE: Summit first-half net profit at S$3.5 mln.</title>
<headline>Summit first-half net profit at S$3.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended June 30, 1996</p>
<p>	   (in millions of S$ unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			 3.55     vs	1.91</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (cents)   2.36     vs	1.32</p>
<p>    Turnover			  15.05     vs	7.78</p>
<p>    Other income		     0.14     vs	0.09</p>
<p>    Interest on borrowings	 0.23     vs	0.17</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		   4.58     vs	1.74</p>
<p>    Tax				  1.30     vs	0.12</p>
<p>Note - Name of the company is SM Summit Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
